# Changelog — 20260308.1914.1

## Ad hoc: Home terminal always starts focused at home directory

### Problem
On workspace restore, the home terminal could inherit a saved CWD from the previous session and a different tab could steal focus.

### Changes
- **`src/renderer/components/App.ts`** — `loadWorkspace()`:
  - Removed `workspace.homeTerminalCwd` from `createHomeTerminal()` call — home terminal always starts fresh at `~`
  - Replaced saved active tab restoration with always focusing the home terminal after restore

